Cho. What's happening?

510
00:48:51,770 --> 00:48:53,855
It's Professor Trelawney.

511
00:49:23,844 --> 00:49:27,514
I have lived and taught here 16 years.

512
00:49:27,681 --> 00:49:30,517
Hogwarts is my home!

513
00:49:32,519 --> 00:49:34,313
You can't do this!

514
00:49:35,856 --> 00:49:38,108
The truth is, yes I can.

515
00:49:46,992 --> 00:49:48,243
Would you like to say something?

516
00:49:48,410 --> 00:49:51,079
I would like to say several things.

517
00:50:07,220 --> 00:50:11,808
Professor McGonagall,
Do you want to escort Sybil inside?

518
00:50:12,976 --> 00:50:15,354
Sybil, dear. Here.

519
00:50:15,771 --> 00:50:18,148
Thank you. Thank you, Albus.

520
00:50:18,565 --> 00:50:22,569
Dumbledore, I remember you
that under the terms...

521
00:50:22,736 --> 00:50:26,073
...of Educational Decree No. 23,
proclaimed by the minister...

522
00:50:26,239 --> 00:50:28,909
You have the right to fire
to my teachers.

523
00:50:29,493 --> 00:50:32,954
You do not have the authority to expel them
of the facilities.

524
00:50:33,246 --> 00:50:36,124
That power is retained by the director.

525
00:50:38,251 --> 00:50:39,419
For now.

526
00:50:45,967 --> 00:50:47,928
Don't they have to study?

527
00:50:48,136 --> 00:50:49,304
Professor!

528
00:50:51,139 --> 00:50:52,557
Professor!

529
00:50:52,724 --> 00:50:55,435
Professor Dumbledore? Teacher!

530
00:50:55,602 --> 00:50:57,312
Professor Dumbledore!

531
00:51:08,490 --> 00:51:10,534
<i>Vile, evil gargoyle!</i>

532
00:51:10,951 --> 00:51:12,911
We are not learning to defend ourselves.

533
00:51:13,412 --> 00:51:15,831
We are not learning to pass OWLs.

534
00:51:16,456 --> 00:51:18,458
It's taking over the school.

535
00:51:18,750 --> 00:51:23,422
<i>Security is and will be the most
high priority of the Ministry.</i>

536
00:51:23,588 --> 00:51:26,425
<i>What's more, we have convincing evidence...</i>

537
00:51:26,591 --> 00:51:31,638
...that these disappearances are the work
of the notorious multiple murderer...</i>

538
00:51:31,805 --> 00:51:32,931
<i>...Sirius Black.</i>

539
00:51:33,682 --> 00:51:34,766
Harry!

540
00:51:35,434 --> 00:51:36,768
Sirius!

541
00:51:37,978 --> 00:51:40,605
- What are you doing here?
- Answering your letter.

542
00:51:40,814 --> 00:51:43,775
You're worried about Umbridge.
What is he doing?

543
00:51:43,942 --> 00:51:45,819
Training them to kill half-breeds?

544
00:51:45,986 --> 00:51:48,905
- He doesn't let us use magic.
- I'm not surprised.

545
00:51:49,406 --> 00:51:53,493
As I understand it, Fudge doesn't want
that are trained for combat.

546
00:51:53,702 --> 00:51:54,870
Combat?

547
