556
00:52:26,234 --> 00:52:27,903
What can we do?

557
00:52:28,236 --> 00:52:29,696
Someone is coming!

558
00:52:29,863 --> 00:52:32,032
Sorry for not being able to help you more.

559
00:52:32,199 --> 00:52:37,204
It seems that for now they will have
than to fend for themselves.

560
