<i>Harry-</i>

564
00:53:28,713 --> 00:53:31,091
It's crazy!
Who is going to want me as a teacher?

565
00:53:31,258 --> 00:53:32,467
I'm crazy.

566
00:53:32,634 --> 00:53:36,805
Look on the bright side, you can't be
worse than toad face.

567
00:53:37,389 --> 00:53:40,517
- Thanks, Ron.
- You have my full support, friend.

568
00:53:41,351 --> 00:53:43,562
Who is going to come?

569
