Just a couple of people.

570
00:53:50,986 --> 00:53:52,779
What a lovely place.

571
00:53:56,116 --> 00:53:58,285
An isolated place seemed safer to me.

572
00:54:09,045 --> 00:54:10,505
Hello.

573
00:54:10,755 --> 00:54:13,508
Everyone knows why we are here.

574
00:54:13,675 --> 00:54:14,926
We need a teacher.

575
00:54:16,636 --> 00:54:18,638
A trained teacher.

576
00:54:19,097 --> 00:54:22,142
Someone who has defended themselves
against the dark arts.

577
00:54:22,434 --> 00:54:24,102
