Is it true that you can do
The Patronus Charm?

587
00:54:54,007 --> 00:54:55,550
Yes.

588
00:54:56,885 --> 00:54:58,261
I have seen it.

589
00:54:58,637 --> 00:55:00,639
I didn't know you could.

590
00:55:01,306 --> 00:55:05,435
And he killed a basilisk, with the sword
from Dumbledore's office.

591
00:55:05,602 --> 00:55:06,853
- It's true.
- In third...

592
00:55:07,020 --> 00:55:09,773
...fought against a hundred dementors.

593
00:55:11,066 --> 00:55:13,860
And last year, he fought
against You-Know-Who in person.

594
00:55:14,027 --> 00:55:15,362
Wait.

595
00:55:16,029 --> 00:55:20,784
Everything sounds wonderful
when they say it like that...

596
00:55:21,534 --> 00:55:24,329
...but, the truth is, most
Most of the time it was pure luck.

597
00:55:24,579 --> 00:55:28,208
I didn't know what I was doing,
I almost always had help.

598
00:55:28,458 --> 00:55:31,670
- He's being modest.
- No, it's not modesty.

599
00:55:34,422 --> 00:55:39,135
Face these things in real life
It's not like at school.

600
00:55:40,178 --> 00:55:43,723
At school, if you make a mistake
you try again.

601
00:55:43,890 --> 00:55:45,392
But out there...

602
00:55:45,892 --> 00:55:49,270
...when you are a second away
of being murdered...

603
00:55:49,437 --> 00:55:52,857
...or you're seeing a friend
die before your eyes...

604
00:55:55,777 --> 00:55:57,987
They don't know what it feels like.

605
00:56:07,247 --> 00:56:09,124
You're right, we don't know.

606
00:56:09,999 --> 00:56:11,960
That's why we need your help.

607
00:56:12,460 --> 00:56:14,963
Because if we want to be able to win...

608
00:56:17,382 --> 00:56:19,134
...to Voldemort...

609
00:56:22,137 --> 00:56:23,763
It's really back.

610
00:56:37,610 --> 00:56:39,654
DUMBLEDORE'S ARMY

611
00:56:46,453 --> 00:56:49,289
we need a place
that Umbridge can't find out.

612
00:56:49,456 --> 00:56:51,791
- The Shrieking House.
- Too small.

613
00:56:51,958 --> 00:56:54,919
- The Forbidden Forest?
- Very unlikely.

614
00:56:55,545 --> 00:56:57,172
And what if Umbridge finds out?

615
00:56:57,338 --> 00:56:58,757
What does it matter?

616
00:56:59,090 --> 00:57:03,636
I mean, it's exciting, right?
Break the rules?

617
00:57:04,137 --> 00:57:06,306
Who are you and where is Hermione?

618
00:57:06,890 --> 00:57:10,727
At least we know that today
We achieved a positive thing.

619
00:57:10,977 --> 00:57:12,145
What thing?

