We must ensure
that he can't find us.

624
00:57:29,662 --> 00:57:31,164
Okay, Harry.

625
00:57:40,006 --> 00:57:44,344
<i>From now on, every organization
student is dissolved.</i>

626
00:57:44,511 --> 00:57:48,014
<i>Every student will be expelled
to defy this order.</i>

627
