The Room of Requirement only appears
when someone needs it.

632
00:58:38,398 --> 00:58:41,067
It is always equipped
for the needs of those who seek it.

633
00:58:41,234 --> 00:58:44,654
Let's say you need a toilet.

634
00:58:46,155 --> 00:58:51,077
Lovely, Ronald.
But yeah, that's the general idea.

635
00:58:51,244 --> 00:58:55,540
It's great. It seems that Hogwarts
He wants us to defend ourselves.

636
00:59:07,093 --> 00:59:08,595
