00:59:26,613 --> 00:59:29,532
...for maximum retention.

641
00:59:29,782 --> 00:59:33,620
- They don't need to talk.
- Rather we don't need to think.

642
00:59:33,870 --> 00:59:36,164
<i>-Expellarmus!
- Put away your wands.</i>

643
00:59:48,801 --> 00:59:51,804
The stunning spell is
one of the most useful weapons.

644
00:59:51,971 --> 00:59:54,265
It is an essential weapon of magicians.

645
00:59:54,474 --> 00:59:57,977
Let's see, Nigel. Be careful.

646
