- Thank you.
- Be quiet.

654
01:00:52,073 --> 01:00:56,369
I let her do that.
You have to be polite, right?

655
01:00:59,038 --> 01:01:01,374
It was completely intentional.

656
01:01:22,145 --> 01:01:23,896
STUDENTS WILL BE INTERROGED

657
01:01:24,063 --> 01:01:25,565
