683
01:04:09,061 --> 01:04:12,064
And I congratulate you for your excellent work.

684
01:04:17,236 --> 01:04:18,654
Well done, friend.

685
01:04:18,821 --> 01:04:20,239
Thank you.

686
01:04:25,912 --> 01:04:27,788
See you after Christmas.

687
01:04:37,632 --> 01:04:39,800
See you in the Common Room, Harry.

688
01:04:41,135 --> 01:04:43,596
- Thank you very much, Harry.
- You are welcome.

689
01:04:44,931 --> 01:04:48,017
Merry Christmas. You are welcome.
Merry christmas.

