- I'm not weak!
- Prove it.

1002
01:32:22,628 --> 01:32:24,589
Control your emotions.

1003
01:32:24,755 --> 01:32:27,258
Discipline your mind.

1004
01:32:30,553 --> 01:32:31,596
<i>Legeremens!</i>

1005
01:32:38,936 --> 01:32:40,062
<i>Harry-</i>

1006
01:32:40,229 --> 01:32:41,814
Sirius!

1007
01:32:42,607 --> 01:32:43,941
<i>I'm going to vomit.</i>

1008
01:32:44,483 --> 01:32:45,526
Enough!

1009
01:32:46,444 --> 01:32:48,613
Do you call this control?

1010
01:32:49,238 --> 01:32:51,782
We've been here for hours.
I need to rest!

1011
01:32:52,033 --> 01:32:55,786
The Dark Lord
He is not resting.

1012
01:32:57,496 --> 01:32:59,415
You and Black, you're both the same...

1013
01:32:59,582 --> 01:33:03,544
Sentimental children, complaining
always about how unfair his life is.

1014
01:33:03,711 --> 01:33:07,089
Maybe you haven't noticed,
but life is not fair.

1015
01:33:07,256 --> 01:33:10,968
Your blessed father knew it.
He was responsible for being unfair.

1016
01:33:11,135 --> 01:33:14,305
- My father was a great man!
- Your father was a pig!

1017
01:33:15,473 --> 01:33:16,974
<i>'Legeremens!
- I protect!</i>

1018
01:33:22,521 --> 01:33:24,065
Come on, Moony, Padfoot!

1019
01:33:24,231 --> 01:33:26,317
<i>Snape'. Expelliarmus!</i>

1020
01:33:26,484 --> 01:33:28,194
Very good, James!

1021
01:33:28,694 --> 01:33:30,821
<i>Dad.
- lmped! mint!</i>

1022
01:33:31,155 --> 01:33:33,157
<i>Greasy Whiner!</i>

1023
01:33:33,532 --> 01:33:36,369
Who wants to see me take away
the pants to Quejiquis?

1024
01:33:38,579 --> 01:33:39,789
Enough.

1025
01:33:41,749 --> 01:33:43,250
Enough.

1026
01:33:51,842 --> 01:33:54,470
Your lessons are over.

1027
01:33:54,637 --> 01:33:55,763
I don't...

1028
01:33:55,930 --> 01:33:59,016
Go away.

