- What's your name?
-Michael.

1030
01:34:18,744 --> 01:34:20,663
Your hand is going to heal, Michael.

1031
01:34:20,830 --> 01:34:23,874
It's not as serious as it seems. Look.

1032
01:34:24,041 --> 01:34:25,960
It's already disappearing.

1033
01:34:26,210 --> 01:34:30,631
Ours are barely seen and the pain
for after a while.

1034
01:34:38,264 --> 01:34:41,058
As I already told you, Mr. Potter...

1035
01:34:41,225 --> 01:34:44,812
...the stupid children
They deserve to be punished.

1036
01:34:48,065 --> 01:34:49,316
You know what, George?

1037
01:34:49,525 --> 01:34:53,070
Our futures lie
outside the academic world.

1038
01:34:53,404 --> 01:34:57,700
I have been thinking
exactly the same.

1039
01:34:58,659 --> 01:35:01,078
SILENCE T.l.M.O.s
EXAMS. - 5th. YEAR

1040
01:35:01,579 --> 01:35:03,330
EXAM: SPELL THEORY

