I need that prophecy.

1044
01:38:18,108 --> 01:38:19,818
You'll have to kill me.

1045
01:38:21,445 --> 01:38:25,282
I will kill you.
But first, you are going to bring it to me.

1046
01:38:25,532 --> 01:38:27,117
<i>Crucio!</i>

1047
01:38:29,578 --> 01:38:31,455
<i>Crucio!</i>

1048
01:38:42,925 --> 01:38:44,301
Sirius!

