Sirius said Voldemort wanted something...

1054
01:38:54,728 --> 01:38:58,023
...which I didn't have last time,
of the Department of Mysteries.

1055
01:38:58,190 --> 01:38:59,900
Harry, listen to me.

1056
01:39:01,485 --> 01:39:03,529
What if Voldemort wanted you to see that?

1057
01:39:04,947 --> 01:39:07,783
What if it's just hurting
to Sirius to catch you?

1058
01:39:07,950 --> 01:39:11,495
So what? Should I let him die?

1059
01:39:11,912 --> 01:39:15,332
Hermione, he's the only relative
What's left for me?

1060
01:39:18,002 --> 01:39:19,336
What do we do?

1061
01:39:20,421 --> 01:39:22,047
You have to use the Floo Network.

1062
01:39:22,214 --> 01:39:24,300
Umbridge watches the chimneys.

1063
