When is it going to get into your head?
We are in this together.

1068
01:39:50,826 --> 01:39:53,871
That, without a doubt.

1069
01:39:54,204 --> 01:39:56,957
He wanted to help the Weasley girl.

1070
01:40:02,087 --> 01:40:04,214
You were going to go with Dumbledore, right?

1071
01:40:04,381 --> 01:40:06,383
- No.
- Liar!

1072
01:40:06,550 --> 01:40:09,303
- Did you send for me, Madam Director?
- Snape, yes.

1073
01:40:09,553 --> 01:40:12,931
I need answers,
even if he doesn't want to give them to me.

1074
01:40:13,474 --> 01:40:15,017
Did you bring the Veritaserum?

1075
01:40:15,184 --> 01:40:18,062
He used it all interrogating students...

1076
01:40:18,228 --> 01:40:21,190
