What is Canute? What is hidden?
What are you talking about, Snape?

1083
01:40:53,680 --> 01:40:55,933
I have no idea.

1084
01:41:00,145 --> 01:41:01,772
Very good.

1085
01:41:02,773 --> 01:41:05,025
You don't leave me any alternative.

1086
01:41:05,275 --> 01:41:08,445
How is it a question
Ministry security...

1087
01:41:08,612 --> 01:41:10,697
...you won't let me...

1088
01:41:11,407 --> 01:41:13,409
...no alternative.

1089
01:41:14,201 --> 01:41:16,286
The cruciatus curse will make you talk.

1090
01:41:16,578 --> 01:41:17,579
That's illegal.

1091
01:41:17,746 --> 01:41:20,999
What Cornelius doesn't know won't hurt him.

1092
01:41:28,549 --> 01:41:30,300
Ibile, Harry!

1093
01:41:31,593 --> 01:41:33,011
Tell me what?

1094
01:41:34,304 --> 01:41:36,181
If you don't tell him where it is...

1095
01:41:36,974 --> 01:41:38,600
...I'll tell him.

1096
01:41:40,269 --> 01:41:42,020
Where is what?

1097
01:41:43,355 --> 01:41:45,607
Dumbledore's secret weapon.

1098
01:41:50,654 --> 01:41:52,197
How much is left?

1099
01:41:52,364 --> 01:41:54,032
It's not far.

1100
01:41:56,034 --> 01:41:59,746
It had to be in an inaccessible place
for students.

1101
01:42:04,084 --> 01:42:05,544
What are you doing?

1102
01:42:05,711 --> 01:42:07,421
Improvising.

1103
01:42:16,013 --> 01:42:17,473
Well?

1104
01:42:18,932 --> 01:42:20,851
Where is this weapon?

1105
01:42:25,898 --> 01:42:28,233
It doesn't exist, right?

1106
01:42:30,903 --> 01:42:33,363
They wanted to deceive me.

1107
01:42:37,367 --> 01:42:38,952
You know what?

1108
01:42:40,287 --> 01:42:42,289
I really hate children.

1109
01:42:57,804 --> 01:43:02,226
You have nothing to do here.
This is a matter of the Ministry.

1110
01:43:04,978 --> 01:43:06,730
Put down your weapons.

1111
01:43:06,897 --> 01:43:12,444
I warn you, as creatures
almost human intelligence...

1112
01:43:12,611 --> 01:43:13,862
<i>Protect!</i>

1113
01:43:14,029 --> 01:43:15,155
How dare you?

1114
01:43:15,906 --> 01:43:17,324
Filthy mongrel!

1115
01:43:18,200 --> 01:43:19,201
<i>Incarcerus!</i>

1116
01:43:32,422 --> 01:43:35,008
Please! Please, stop it!

1117
01:43:35,175 --> 01:43:39,846
Enough! I insist that there be order!

1118
01:43:49,314 --> 01:43:51,149
Disgusting animal!

1119
01:43:51,441 --> 01:43:54,403
Do you know who I am?

1120
01:43:54,570 --> 01:43:57,322
Leave him alone!
It's not his fault!

1121
01:43:57,573 --> 01:43:59,324
He doesn't understand!

1122
01:44:07,124 --> 01:44:10,586
Do something!
Tell them I don't want to hurt them!

1123
01:44:10,752 --> 01:44:12,671
I'm sorry, teacher.

1124
01:44:12,838 --> 01:44:14,464
I must not tell lies.

1125
01:44:14,631 --> 01:44:15,799
What do they do?

1126
01:44:15,966 --> 01:44:19,970
I am the senior undersecretary
Dolores Jane Umbridge!

1127
01:44:20,304 --> 01:44:22,347
Let me go!

1128
01:44:25,142 --> 01:44:26,977
Thanks, Grawp.

1129
01:44:27,144 --> 01:44:30,397
Hermione. Sirius!

1130
01:44:38,947 --> 01:44:42,492
- How did they escape?
- Vomiting pills. It wasn't pretty.

1131
01:44:42,743 --> 01:44:44,661
I said I was hungry,
I wanted a sweet.

1132
01:44:45,078 --> 01:44:47,789
They let me go
and they ate them.

1133
01:44:48,332 --> 01:44:49,833
How clever, Ron.

1134
01:44:50,667 --> 01:44:53,170
- It's happened before.
- It was brilliant!

1135
01:44:53,337 --> 01:44:55,047
How are we going to go to London?

1136
01:44:56,506 --> 01:44:59,676
It's not that I don't thank them
everything they have done.

1137
01:45:00,969 --> 01:45:03,513
But I already put them in
in enough trouble.

1138
01:45:03,680 --> 01:45:06,892
Dumbledore's Army
must do something real.

1139
01:45:07,059 --> 01:45:09,311
Or were they mere words?

1140
01:45:11,063 --> 01:45:14,066
Maybe you don't have to do everything alone.

1141
01:45:19,196 --> 01:45:21,239
How are we going to get to London?

1142
01:45:22,741 --> 01:45:24,910
Flying, of course.

1143
01:46:15,919 --> 01:46:18,088
<i>Department of Mysteries.</i>

1144
01:46:27,055 --> 01:46:28,765
Here it is.

1145
01:47:21,735 --> 01:47:23,987
92, 93.

1146
01:47:25,614 --> 01:47:26,990
94.

1147
01:47:28,325 --> 01:47:29,326
95.

1148
01:47:42,005 --> 01:47:43,673
It should be here!

1149
01:47:44,174 --> 01:47:45,342
Harry.

1150
01:47:47,344 --> 01:47:48,678
It has your name.

1151
01:48:13,954 --> 01:48:18,208
<i>He who has the power to win
The Dark Lord approaches.</i>

1152
01:48:19,042 --> 01:48:21,586
<i>The Dark Lord will consider him his equal.</i>

1153
01:48:21,753 --> 01:48:24,339
<i>You will have a power that you lack
to the Dark Lord.</i>

1154
01:48:30,053 --> 01:48:35,100
<i>Well one cannot live
while the other survives.</i>

1155
01:48:38,061 --> 01:48:39,646
Harry!

1156
01:48:49,656 --> 01:48:51,157
