You only saw what the Dark Lord
I wanted you to see.

1160
01:49:08,425 --> 01:49:09,926
Now give me the prophecy.

1161
01:49:10,093 --> 01:49:12,095
If it hurts us, I break it.

1162
01:49:14,931 --> 01:49:17,142
He knows how to play!

1163
01:49:17,434 --> 01:49:21,396
That little baby.

1164
01:49:21,646 --> 01:49:22,772
Potter.

1165
01:49:23,440 --> 01:49:25,317
Bellatrix Lestrange.

1166
01:49:25,483 --> 01:49:28,528
Is it Neville Longbottom?
How are mom and dad?

1167
01:49:28,695 --> 01:49:30,405
IMGJOF, since I'm going to avenge them!

1168
01:49:33,950 --> 01:49:38,288
We all have to calm down...

1169
01:49:38,580 --> 01:49:40,081
...okay?

1170
01:49:40,290 --> 01:49:42,709
We just want that prophecy.

1171
01:49:42,959 --> 01:49:44,961
Why did Voldemort need
What came for this?

1172
01:49:45,128 --> 01:49:46,755
Do you dare to say his name?

1173
01:49:48,423 --> 01:49:50,050
Mixed blood pig!

1174
01:49:50,216 --> 01:49:52,677
It's okay,
He's just a curious boy, right?

1175
01:49:54,721 --> 01:49:59,935
They can only recover the prophecies
those on whom they were made...

1176
01:50:00,226 --> 01:50:02,979
...which was lucky for you, actually.

1177
01:50:06,858 --> 01:50:08,985
Haven't you always wondered...

1178
01:50:09,402 --> 01:50:14,366
...why is there a connection
between you and the Dark Lord?

1179
01:50:15,241 --> 01:50:17,661
Why couldn't he kill you...

1180
01:50:17,827 --> 01:50:20,330
...when you were just a baby?

1181
01:50:21,831 --> 01:50:26,503
Don't you want to know the secret
of your scar?

1182
01:50:27,545 --> 01:50:31,841
All the answers are there,
Potter, in your hand.

1183
01:50:33,176 --> 01:50:35,220
You just need...

1184
01:50:35,679 --> 01:50:37,597
...give it to me...

1185
01:50:38,056 --> 01:50:41,142
...and I will show you everything.

1186
01:50:49,901 --> 01:50:51,695
I've waited 14 years.

1187
01:50:52,404 --> 01:50:53,613
I already know.

1188
01:50:55,031 --> 01:50:57,951
<i>I can wait</i> a little longer.
Now! Faint!</i>

1189
01:51:15,677 --> 01:51:16,720
<i>Levicorpus!</i>

1190
01:51:23,226 --> 01:51:25,228
<i>Petrificus Totalus!</i>

1191
01:51:25,437 --> 01:51:27,230
Very good, Neville.

1192
01:51:35,697 --> 01:51:37,198
<i>Fainting!</i>

1193
01:51:38,992 --> 01:51:40,410
<i>Fainting!</i>

1194
01:51:51,254 --> 01:51:52,797
<i>Fainting!</i>

1195
01:52:00,722 --> 01:52:02,474
<i>Reducto!</i>

1196
01:52:19,115 --> 01:52:21,117
Get back to the door!

1197
01:52:56,528 --> 01:53:00,865
Department of Mysteries.
An apt name, right?

1198
