The voices.

1199
01:53:08,706 --> 01:53:10,750
Do you distinguish what they say?

1200
01:53:12,293 --> 01:53:14,587
There are no voices, Harry.

1201
01:53:15,213 --> 01:53:17,006
Let's get out of here.

1202
01:53:17,173 --> 01:53:18,758
I hear them too.

1203
01:53:21,970 --> 01:53:24,514
Harry, it's just an empty arch.

1204
01:53:27,350 --> 01:53:29,269
Please, Harry!

1205
01:53:29,519 --> 01:53:31,271
Get behind me!

1206
01:54:17,942 --> 01:54:20,653
Did you really believe...?

1207
01:54:20,820 --> 01:54:25,241
Were you naive enough to believe...

1208
01:54:26,075 --> 01:54:31,080
...than some children
were they going to be able to against us?

1209
