I'm going to make this very easy for you, Potter.

1210
01:54:42,091 --> 01:54:45,303
Give me the prophecy now...

1211
01:54:45,929 --> 01:54:49,432
...or you will see your friends die.

1212
01:55:02,278 --> 01:55:03,780
Don't give it to him, Harry!

1213
01:55:30,223 --> 01:55:32,809
Stay away from my godson.

1214
01:56:02,964 --> 01:56:05,842
Listen to me well.
Get the others out of here.

1215
01:56:06,009 --> 01:56:07,844
No. I'm staying with you.

1216
01:56:08,011 --> 01:56:10,513
You have tried hard.

1217
01:56:11,347 --> 01:56:13,182
Now leave this to me.

1218
01:56:13,349 --> 01:56:14,350
Black!

1219
01:56:41,502 --> 01:56:42,712
<i>Expelliarmus!</i>

1220
01:56:42,879 --> 01:56:44,380
Very good, James!

1221
01:56:51,554 --> 01:56:53,056
<i>Avada Kedavra!</i>

1222
01:57:39,519 --> 01:57:42,063
I killed Sirius Black!

1223
01:57:43,147 --> 01:57:45,108
<i>-Are you coming for me?
- Crucio!</i>

1224
01:57:57,453 --> 01:58:00,623
<i>You have to be serious, Harry.</i>

1225
01:58:00,790 --> 01:58:04,460
<i>She killed him. He deserves it.</i>

1226
01:58:08,131 --> 01:58:11,092
<i>You know that charm, Harry.</i>

1227
01:58:23,146 --> 01:58:25,106
Use it!

1228
01:58:32,238 --> 01:58:35,324
So weak.

1229
01:58:42,165 --> 01:58:45,334
It was reckless
come here tonight, Tom.

1230
01:58:45,543 --> 01:58:47,295
The aurors are on their way.

1231
01:58:47,462 --> 01:58:51,466
When they arrive,
I won't be here anymore and you...

1232
01:58:53,176 --> 01:58:55,303
...you will be dead.

1233
02:01:09,604 --> 02:01:11,439
You lost, man.

1234
02:01:36,797 --> 02:01:38,299
<i>So weak.</i>

1235
02:01:38,716 --> 02:01:40,968
<i>So vulnerable.</i>

1236
02:01:45,348 --> 02:01:46,349
Look at me.

1237
02:01:48,851 --> 02:01:53,022
Harry, what matters
They are not their similarities.

1238
02:01:53,272 --> 02:01:56,067
They are their differences.

1239
02:02:34,605 --> 02:02:36,399
You are the weak one...

1240
02:02:36,691 --> 02:02:40,736
...and you will never know love
or friendship.

1241
02:02:44,240 --> 02:02:47,159
And I feel sorry for you.

1242
02:03:10,182 --> 02:03:13,853
You are a fool, Harry Potter.

1243
02:03:14,603 --> 02:03:19,608
And you will lose everything.

1244
02:03:34,665 --> 02:03:36,625
He's back.

1245
02:03:47,094 --> 02:03:49,597
DUMBLEDORE, POTTER
CLAIMED

1246
02:03:49,805 --> 02:03:51,640
WILL THE MINISTER RESIGN?

1247
02:03:55,686 --> 02:03:58,189
SUSPENDED UMBRIDGE
PENDING INVESTIGATION

1248
02:04:00,316 --> 02:04:03,652
RETURN
HE-WHO-MUST-NOT-BE-NAMED

1249
02:04:04,153 --> 02:04:06,614
HOGWARTS DIRECTOR RESTORED

1250
02:04:44,068 --> 02:04:45,736
I know what you're feeling.

1251
02:04:45,903 --> 02:04:47,696
No, he doesn't know.

1252
02:04:53,160 --> 02:04:54,537
It's my fault.

1253
02:04:54,703 --> 02:04:57,832
No, it's my fault.

1254
02:04:58,999 --> 02:05:00,751
I knew that one day...

1255
02:05:00,918 --> 02:05:03,879
...Voldemort would understand
the connection between you.

1256
02:05:04,797 --> 02:05:09,051
I thought that by distancing myself from you,
like I've done all year...

1257
02:05:09,218 --> 02:05:14,348
...he would be less tempted,
and you would be more protected.

1258
02:05:17,268 --> 02:05:20,521
The prophecy said:

1259
02:05:21,230 --> 02:05:25,609
"Neither of them will be able to live
as long as the other survives.

1260
02:05:26,527 --> 02:05:32,491
It means that one of the two will have
than to kill the other, in the end.

1261
02:05:34,577 --> 02:05:35,995
Yes.

1262
02:05:36,328 --> 02:05:38,163
Why didn't you tell me?

1263
02:05:38,372 --> 02:05:41,792
For the same reason that you tried
to save Sirius.

1264
02:05:42,126 --> 02:05:44,461
For the same reason
that your friends saved you.

1265
02:05:45,421 --> 02:05:48,924
After all these years,
after what you've suffered...

1266
02:05:49,091 --> 02:05:51,927
...I didn't want to cause you more pain.

1267
02:05:53,470 --> 02:05:55,514
I love you too much.

1268
02:06:20,456 --> 02:06:22,791
Why aren't you at the banquet?

1269
02:06:22,958 --> 02:06:27,463
I lost all my possessions.
People hide them from me.

1270
02:06:27,838 --> 02:06:30,633
- How terrible.
- It's just a joke.

1271
02:06:30,925 --> 02:06:34,386
But it's the last night and I need
let them return them to me.

1272
02:06:34,553 --> 02:06:36,805
Do you want me to help you search?

1273
02:06:39,808 --> 02:06:42,978
I'm so sorry to hear about your godfather, Harry.

1274
02:06:50,069 --> 02:06:52,154
Are you sure you don't want me to help you?

1275
02:06:52,321 --> 02:06:53,989
No, it's okay.

1276
02:06:54,156 --> 02:06:56,325
My mom always said...

1277
02:06:56,492 --> 02:07:00,329
...than the things we lose
They come back to us in the end.

1278
02:07:03,582 --> 02:07:06,752
Although not always as we expect.

1279
02:07:08,337 --> 02:07:11,048
I'm just going to go eat pudding.

1280
02:07:46,709 --> 02:07:49,545
I've been thinking about something
What Dumbledore told me.

1281
02:07:49,795 --> 02:07:51,547
In what?

1282
02:07:52,089 --> 02:07:54,717
That although a fight awaits us...

1283
02:07:55,050 --> 02:07:57,886
...we have one thing
which Voldemort doesn't have.

1284
02:07:58,303 --> 02:07:59,722
Yes?

1285
02:08:01,724 --> 02:08:04,226
Something worth defending.

1286
02:10:40,757 --> 02:10:43,552
HARRY POTTER AND THE ORDER OF THE PHOENIX
